desc:TwoStorms Wah
//tags: filter wah
//author: TwoStorms
//version: 1.2
//
// A wah with an Act built in: its output gain, meters, Auto (Target, Match, Reference),
// Drive link and Finale are a TwoStorms Act, so TwoStorms Gain Stage lists and stages it like one.
// One to three parallel wah bands, each a resonant filter (bandpass, lowpass or highpass) swept
// between its own two frequencies, with no latency (no lookahead, no delay). Each band is moved by
// its own control: Manual (a MIDI pedal: a controller or pitch bend, with learn, or the Pedal knob),
// Envelope (follows the level of the input), Transient (kicks open on each pluck and falls back)
// or an LFO (free or synced to the tempo). Detector from the main input or the sidechain (inputs
// 3-4), with its own high-pass. The bands can run in parallel or in series, each can be driven and
// given a steeper slope, and Voice turns the bands into the formants of a human voice: a fake talk
// box. MIDI passes through. Needs REAPER 6.74 or newer.

slider1:0<0,3,1{2,4,6,8}>-Channels
slider2:0<0,2,1{Auto,Always,Never}>-Finale (Auto = the last Act in the chain)
slider3:0<0,2,1{Peak,RMS,LUFS}>-Auto measure
slider4:-12<-60,0,0.01>-Auto target
slider5:4<0,7,1{Manual,1 s,2 s,3 s,5 s,10 s,20 s,30 s}>-Auto time
slider6:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 1-2
slider7:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 3-4
slider8:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 5-6
slider9:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 7-8
slider10:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch1 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider11:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch2 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider12:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch3 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider13:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch4 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider14:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch5 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider15:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch6 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider16:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch7 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider17:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch8 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider18:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch1 used
slider19:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch2 used
slider20:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch3 used
