slider54:0<0,1,1{Parallel,Series}>-Bands 2 and 3
slider55:0<0,3,1{Off,Male,Female,Child}>-Voice (vowel formants)
slider56:0<0,4,1{Wah (oo-ah),Wow (oo-ah-oo),Yeah (ee-ae),Oo-ah-ee,Vowel sweep (oo oh ah eh ee)}>-Vowel path
